 49	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 50	//
 51	// Only a single HTTP server and a single PollingManager can be active per
 52	// Node.js process.  This is intentional for the CLI use case.
 53	//
 54	// **Test authors:** always call `await stopServer()` in an `afterEach` /
 55	// `afterAll` hook to release the port and reset these references before the
 56	// next test suite starts a fresh server.
