145	 * | PUT    | /api/config/polling     | Update the polling interval (min 10 s, max 86400 s)  |
146	 *
147	 * **Webserver URL endpoints:**
148	 *
149	 * | Method | Path                         | Description                              |
150	 * |--------|------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
151	 * | GET    | /api/config/webserver-url    | Return current `webserverUrl` (or null)  |
152	 * | PUT    | /api/config/webserver-url    | Update the webserver URL                 |
